   named `tool:<name>` TOOL span with `ok` status, `error` status for a
   failed dispatch, and byte-identical tool-result output whether or not
   tracing is enabled).
6. tests/units/agents/test_agent_tracing.py — added `TestTraceToolStatus`
   (3 tests: `status="ok"` for a plain result, `status="error"` for a JSON
   `{"error": ...}` result, `status="ok"` for a non-JSON string result).
7. tests/eval/test_staged_contract.py (new) — 8 focused pytest tests
